{"id": "183", "question": "how to cook a small prime rib roast in oven", "gt": "Before cooking the prime rib roast, let it stand at room temperature for at least 1 hour. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F. Season the roast with a small amount of salt and lots of fresh ground black pepper. Place the roast on a rack in a pan with the rib side down and the fatty side up. Roast it in the oven for 1 hour. After cooking, you can prepare au jus by placing the roasting pan on the stove over high heat. Add wine and cook for 8-10 minutes, stirring and scraping any brown bits. Add beef stock and cook to reduce the juice by half, which might take about 20 minutes. Add salt and pepper to taste.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nI need to analyze the given passages to determine if they contain any information about cooking a small prime rib roast in an oven. Let me examine what information is available in the passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 53.6, "generation_time_seconds": 42.7386, "selection_time_seconds": 10.8617, "nemotron": {"method": "tot", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "n_vote": 2, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "185", "question": "how long does it take to make chicken tender in crock pot", "gt": "To make chicken tender in a crock pot, you can cook it on low for 6 - 8 hours or until done. Alternatively, you can cook it on high for 1 hour, then on low for about 5 hours or until done. Another option is cooking it for 4 hours on high.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAnalyze the physical details step by step:  \n- Identify the cooking method specified (crock pot).  \n- Locate any mention of time duration required for chicken to become tender within the crock pot context.  \n- Check for specific numerical values (e.g., hours, minutes) or comparative time references (e.g., \"several hours,\" \"all day\").  \n- Verify if the passage distinguishes between raw chicken preparation time and total cooking time.  \n- Confirm whether the text provides a clear, unambiguous time frame for achieving tenderness.\nAnalyze the physical details step by step:  \n- Identify the cooking method specified (crock pot).  \n- Locate any mention of time duration required for chicken to become tender within the crock pot context.  \n- Check for specific numerical values (e.g., hours, minutes) or comparative time references (e.g., \"several hours,\" \"all day\").  \n- Verify if the passage distinguishes between raw chicken preparation time and total cooking time.  \n- Confirm whether the text provides a clear, unambiguous time frame for achieving tenderness.\nAnalyze the physical details step by step:  \n- Identify the cooking method specified (crock pot).  \n- Locate any mention of time duration required for chicken to become tender within the crock pot context.  \n- Check for specific numerical values (e.g., hours, minutes) or comparative time references (e.g., \"several hours,\" \"al